# Bash-sandbox masking artifacts. The sandbox shells into the repo root with the
# user's profile, and masks personal dotfiles/config by bind-mounting /dev/null
# over them -- they show up as untracked character devices in the repo and would
# otherwise fail the scheduled implementer run's "git status must be clean"
# preflight (docs/automation/implementer-run.md step 1). .vscode/ and .idea/ are
# listed above as directories; the sandbox creates them as files, so the
# trailing-slash patterns do not match and they need their own entries.
/.bash_profile
/.bashrc
/.gitconfig
/.gitmodules
/.mcp.json
/.profile
/.ripgreprc
/.zprofile
/.zshrc
/.idea
/.vscode
/.claude/commands
/.claude/hooks
/.claude/launch.json
/.claude/loop.md
/.claude/output-styles
/.claude/routines
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/skills
/.claude/workflows


# Generated example output (examples write result tables into cwd;
# tracked-output policy per d3d23c0 — example output does not live in git.
# Unignored, these trip every implementer preflight: attempts.md 2026-08-04T00:30Z)
# (the 2026-08-28 rename 67e4c1c prefixed the basename to
# magnetostatics_02_circular_loop_results.txt and orphaned the bare pattern;
# glob covers both — 2026-09-01 09:00 slot, EX-36 leg (root + mri + mat))
*circular_loop_results.txt

# Operator-provided copyrighted reference texts: readable in-repo (the
# sandbox blocks reads outside it) but never committed or pushed.
docs/references/*.epub
docs/references/jin-fem-3e/

# Ansys Electronics Desktop benchmark results (operator directive 2026-09-02).
# Ansys licence terms restrict disclosure of benchmark results, so nothing
# AED-derived is ever committed to this public repository: the operator's AED
# exports and the results JSON live only on the operator's box, the example
# writes the AED-filled comparison table to an untracked sibling file, and the
# weekly review's numeric adjudication goes to docs/private/. Tracked
# COMPARISON.md files keep their AED columns blank by construction.
examples/ansys_benchmarks/*/aed_results/
examples/ansys_benchmarks/*/COMPARISON_private.md
docs/private/*
!docs/private/README.md
